stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> FirstMessage: evaluator sends the task
  FirstMessage --> AskModel: harness adds the files, or a list of where they are
  AskModel --> RunTool: model replies with a tool call
  RunTool --> AskModel: result returns through the evaluator
  AskModel --> FinalAnswer: model replies with no tool call
  RunTool --> BudgetStop: the last allowed reply's tools have finished
  FinalAnswer --> Done: harness sends the model's summary
  BudgetStop --> Done: harness sends a note that the budget ran out
  Done --> [*]: the evaluator grades the files on disk
  note right of AskModel
    Every model reply is one call, with or without a tool.
    Rung 2's note asks for requirements, a data check,
    checks per requirement, and a final double-check.
  end note
